.SH "NAME"
aerospace-list-exec-env-vars \- List environment variables that exec\-* commands and callbacks are run with
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
.nf
aerospace list\-exec\-env\-vars [\-h|\-\-help]
.fi
.br
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
List environment variables that exec\-* commands and callbacks are run with
.sp
Examples of commands and callbacks:
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
\f(CRaerospace exec\-and\-forget\fP command
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
\f(CRexec\-on\-workspace\-change\-callback\fP
.RE
.SH "OPTIONS"
.sp
\-h, \-\-help
.RS 4
Print help
.RE
